The Far Realms of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]] lie on the outskirts of Ushas's sphere. They are not the Joker World of the same name on Færrin's [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/index|Infinite Horizon]].

[[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]] sat in the Far Realms. The party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] reached them through a [[Phenomena/Locus|Locus]] made by the architect of the [[Geography/Ushas/Undermountain|Undermountain]]. On the way to Mephistopheles they came on a broken starship crashed there: an experimental stealth bomber the Fifth Prosperous Empire of the [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Sundom]] built to fight the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessians]]. The descendants of its crew still lived aboard, regressed, with no memory of where they came from or why, nor how to maintain the ship's spell-looms. One of the original crew, the deactivated [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] [[People/Althane/SeRaan|SeRaan]], needed only to be booted back up. Sedecium was founded on what they took from that ship.
